      `screenshots), add [build.args] TOVU_INSTALL_BROWSER = "1" to this file (or deploy with ` +
      `--build-arg TOVU_INSTALL_BROWSER=1) and allow ~150–250 MB more RAM per capture.`,
    ...descriptor.secrets.map(
